==Battleground==
*5 [[Doge Dark]]s spawn after 6.67 seconds<sup>200f</sup>, delay 13.33~20 seconds<sup>400f~600f</sup>.
*Infinite [[Gory Dark]]s spawn after 10 seconds<sup>300f</sup>, delay 26.67~33.33 seconds<sup>800f~1,000f</sup>.
*When the base reaches 99% HP:
**1 [[Director Kurosawah]] spawns as the boss.
**10 [[Shadow Boxer K]]s spawn, delay 0.67 seconds<sup>20f</sup>.
**Infinite [[Shadow Boxer K]]s spawn, delay 36~40 seconds<sup>1,080f~1,200f</sup>.
**Infinite [[Doge Dark]]s spawn, delay 6.67~10 seconds<sup>200f~300f</sup>.

